  # Unlocking ChatGPT: 10 Hidden Prompts Almost No One Knows
  
  ## Level Up Your AI Game With These Secret ChatGPT Prompts
  
  [![Surinder Singh](https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fill:32:32/1*D-cAVySLyXkZ1M-dozCjYA.jpeg)](https://zsurindersingh.medium.com/?source=post_page---byline--93e28e2a595a---------------------------------------)
  
