  ![](https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:700/1*3vDCt2D1xANqbIMeRrJfYw.png)
  
  _Level up your ChatGPT game with these under-the-radar tricks that make the AI feel like your personal assistant._
  
  Ever feel like you’re only scratching the surface of ChatGPT’s capabilities? I did. For months, I thought I was using it fully — until I discovered **hidden prompts and secret tricks** that completely changed the way I interact with it.
  
  ## Get Surinder Singh’s stories in your inbox
  
  Join Medium for free to get updates from this writer.
  
  Subscribe
  
  Subscribe
  
  Remember me for faster sign in
  
  ChatGPT isn’t just a chatbot. It’s more like a **versatile companion** that adapts to your style, tone, and even your learning habits — but only if you know the right prompts to use. These aren’t technical codes or developer tools; they’re simple, human-readable prompts that unlock smarter, faster, and sometimes surprising responses.
  
  ## What Are These Secret Prompts?
  
  Think of them as **verbal cheat codes**. You type them in, and suddenly ChatGPT can:
  
  - Summarize long articles in seconds
  - Explain complex topics in simple terms
  - Adopt professional, humorous, or sarcastic tones
  - Critique and improve its own answers
  
  No coding required — just curiosity and experimentation.
  
  ## 10 Hidden ChatGPT Prompts With Sample Conversations
  
  > **ELI5 (Explain Like I’m 5)**
  >
  > _Prompt:_ ELI5 Quantum Computing
  >
  > **ChatGPT:** “Imagine a magic coin that can be both heads and tails at the same time. Quantum computers use coins like this to solve really tricky problems faster than normal computers.”
  >
  > **2\. TL;DR (Too Long; Didn’t Read)**
  >
  > _Prompt:_ TL;DR \[paste long article\]
  >
  > **ChatGPT:** “This article explains how electric cars can reduce pollution, save money on fuel, and change transportation over the next decade.”
  >
  > **3\. Jargonize (Professional Mode)**
  >
  > _Prompt:_ Jargonize: I fixed the marketing issue.
  >
  > **ChatGPT:** “Implemented a strategic solution to optimize the marketing funnel, enhancing conversion efficiency across target demographics.”
  >
  > **4\. Humanize (Remove AI Voice)**
  >
  > _Prompt:_ Humanize: I implemented a solution to the marketing problem.
  >
  > **ChatGPT:** “I worked out a fix for the marketing problem, and it’s already making things run smoother.”
  >
  > **5\. Feynman Technique (Deep Learning)**
  >
  > _Prompt:_ Explain blockchain using Feynman technique
  >
  > **ChatGPT:** “Step 1: Imagine a notebook everyone can see…
  >
  > Step 2: Each page is a block…
  >
  > Step 3: Everyone agrees on new pages…
  >
  > Step 4: If something is wrong, it’s easy to spot and fix.”
  >
  > **6\. Socratic Method (Interactive Learning)**
  >
  > _Prompt:_ Teach me photosynthesis using Socratic method
  >
  > **ChatGPT:** “Why do you think plants need sunlight?”
  >
  > _You reply:_ “To make food?”
  >
  > **ChatGPT:** “Exactly! Sunlight helps plants convert water and carbon dioxide into energy through a process called photosynthesis.”
  >
  > **7\. Rewrite Like \[Someone\]**
  >
  > _Prompt:_ Rewrite like a sarcastic Redditor: I love Mondays.
  >
  > **ChatGPT:** “Oh, Mondays? Can’t wait to wake up early and stare at spreadsheets. Living the dream.”
  >
  > **8\. Inverse Prompt (Reverse Engineering)**
  >
  > _Prompt:_ What prompt would generate this output? \[paste content\]
  >
  > **ChatGPT:** “You could ask: ‘Explain \[topic\] in 3 concise points for social media readers.’”
  >
  > **9\. Temperature Control (Creativity Levels)**
  >
  > _Prompt:_ Write a short story about a cat. Temperature: high creativity
  >
  > **ChatGPT:** “The cat wore a tiny leather jacket and skateboarded across rooftops, delivering secret messages to the neighborhood squirrels…”
  >
  > **10\. Self Critique (Auto Improvement)**
  >
  > _Prompt:_ \[paste essay\] Now critique your response and improve it for clarity and tone.
  >
  > **ChatGPT:** “I simplified some sentences, corrected grammar, and made the tone more engaging for a casual audience.”
  
  These tricks aren’t just tips — they’re **superpowers**. Whether you’re creating content, learning faster, or boosting productivity, these hidden prompts make ChatGPT feel more like a **creative partner than a chatbot**.
  
  Most users never go beyond the basics. But now you’re in the 1%. Experiment with these, tweak them, and watch how your AI interactions transform.
  
  Next time someone says, “It’s just a chatbot,” smile. You know something they don’t.
  
