  ## Unlock the full power of ChatGPT you’re just a few hacks away from next-level productivity.
  
  # Beyond the Basics: 3 Jaw-Dropping ChatGPT Hacks to Blow Your Mind (+ 2 Hidden Gems)
  
  ## Discover three advanced ChatGPT tricks and two hidden features that will transform how you work, learn, and create.
  
  [![Ankita Deo](https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fill:64:64/1*8dPRPdAe1sOs1Biu_Zqr1g.jpeg)](https://medium.com/@ankita.gsdc?source=post_page---byline--7852a4a081ff---------------------------------------)
  
